.TH FLATPAK-INSTALL-GUI 1 "October 2026" "1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
flatpak-install-gui \- compatibility command for Mainuan Flatpak installer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B flatpak-install-gui
.RI [ file.flatpakref ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs mainuan-flatpak-install-gui with the same arguments.
Removal requires --remove --scope user|system|system:ID and a local reference,
with graphical confirmation.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mainuan-flatpak-install-gui (1)
